TIHabModuleTemplate.displayName.PointDefenseArray_T0=Point Defense Array - Tier 0
TIHabModuleTemplate.description.PointDefenseArray_T0=A super basic (Tier 0) battery of defensive weaponry to protect the hab from attack. It will automatically upgrade weapons and armor as we develop new technologies.
TIHabModuleTemplate.displayName.PointDefenseArray=Point Defense Array - Tier 1
TIHabModuleTemplate.description.PointDefenseArray=An improved battery of defensive weaponry to protect the hab from attack. Provides enhanced point defense coverage with upgraded systems and improved targeting.
TIHabModuleTemplate.displayName.AutomatedPointDefenseArray=Automated Point Defense Array - only for small autonomous bases or platforms.
TIHabModuleTemplate.description.AutomatedPointDefenseArray=A fully automated point defense array designed for small bases or platforms, providing continuous protection against incoming threats without the need for manual operation. This module is ideal for remote outposts or unmanned installations, ensuring the safety of critical infrastructure with minimal maintenance requirements.
TIHabModuleTemplate.displayName.LayeredDefenseArray=Layered Defense Array
TIHabModuleTemplate.description.LayeredDefenseArray=An advanced multi-layered defensive platform that integrates overlapping weapon systems and point defense networks to protect the hab from coordinated attacks. Provides superior coverage against both missile and kinetic threats.
TIHabModuleTemplate.displayName.Battlestations=Battlestations
TIHabModuleTemplate.description.Battlestations=A massive orbital fortress module equipped with devastating heavy weapons arrays, layered armor plating, and advanced targeting systems. Transforms a habitat into an impregnable stronghold capable of engaging entire enemy fleets.

TIHabModuleTemplate.displayName.MiningRefiningModule_lvl1=Small Mining & Refining Module
TIHabModuleTemplate.description.MiningRefiningModule_lvl1=A small and advanced module designed to enhance mining and refining operations at outposts, improving resource extraction and processing efficiency by 15%
TIHabModuleTemplate.displayName.MiningRefiningModule_lvl2=Medium Mining & Refining Module
TIHabModuleTemplate.description.MiningRefiningModule_lvl2=A medium and advanced module designed to enhance mining and refining operations at outposts, improving resource extraction and processing efficiency by 30%
TIHabModuleTemplate.displayName.MiningRefiningModule_lvl3=Large Mining & Refining Module
TIHabModuleTemplate.description.MiningRefiningModule_lvl3=A large and advanced module designed to enhance mining and refining operations at outposts, improving resource extraction and processing efficiency by 50%

TIHabModuleTemplate.displayName.AutomatedRefinery=Small Automated Mining & Refining Module
TIHabModuleTemplate.description.AutomatedRefinery=A small and fully automated advanced module designed to enhance mining and refining operations at outposts, improving resource extraction and processing efficiency by 30%
TIHabModuleTemplate.displayName.AutomatedQuantumMiniReactor=Automated Quantum Mini Reactor
TIHabModuleTemplate.description.AutomatedQuantumMiniReactor=A compact and fully automated quantum mini reactor module designed to provide efficient and reliable power generation for outposts, ensuring continuous operation and supporting various energy needs with minimal maintenance.
TIHabModuleTemplate.displayName.AutomatedQuantumSingularityReactor=Automated Quantum Singularity Reactor
TIHabModuleTemplate.description.AutomatedQuantumSingularityReactor=A compact and fully automated quantum singularity reactor module designed to provide efficient and reliable power generation for outposts, ensuring continuous operation and supporting various energy needs with minimal maintenance.

TIHabModuleTemplate.displayName.SingularityPile=Singularity Pile
TIHabModuleTemplate.description.SingularityPile=A basic singularity pile module that harnesses the power of micro-singularities to generate energy. This module serves as an entry-level power source for hab modules, providing a stable and efficient energy supply for various operations while we develop more advanced technologies.
TIHabModuleTemplate.displayName.SingularityReactorArray=Singularity Reactor Array
TIHabModuleTemplate.description.SingularityReactorArray=A basic singularity reactor array module that harnesses the power of micro-singularities to generate energy. This module serves as an entry-level power source for hab modules, providing a stable and efficient energy supply for various operations while we develop more advanced technologies.
TIHabModuleTemplate.displayName.SingularityReactorFarm=Singularity Reactor Farm
TIHabModuleTemplate.description.SingularityReactorFarm=A basic singularity reactor farm module that harnesses the power of micro-singularities to generate energy. This module serves as an entry-level power source for hab modules, providing a stable and efficient energy supply for various operations while we develop more advanced technologies.
